<p class=MsoNormal><b><i><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:black'>Questions 10-15</span></i></b><i><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman";color:black'> ask about changes in standards and demand over
the past three months for three different types of commercial real estate (CRE)
loans at your bank: construction and land development loans, loans secured by nonfarm
nonresidential properties, and loans secured by multifamily residential
properties. Please report changes in enforcement of existing policies as
changes in policies. </span></i><span style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

