report them as unchanged even if they are either restrictive or accommodative
relative to longer-term norms. If your bank's credit standards have tightened
or eased over the relevant period, please so report them regardless of how they
stand relative to longer-term norms. Also, please report changes in enforcement
of existing standards as changes in standards. </span></i><span
style='mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

